{"3363050": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Piñata Puppy World", "steam_appid": 3363050, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h1>WEBSITE OUT NOW!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363050/extras/695f18c3a27a65ce116c05089705ea5f.avif?t=1781403678\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363050/extras_big/695f18c3a27a65ce116c05089705ea5f.webp?t=1781403678 width=1560 height=1316 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Wait, you don't know?</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the World Wide Web <strong>based on Piñata Puppy World</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play games, explore the town of Memory Lane, and meet all your favorite characters from The Piñata Puppy Show! Help them bake, prepare for the party, and even find out more about the new kids museum, coming to life soon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363050/extras/4939f316a353f0bae14ce4e5673bcbf2.avif?t=1781403678\" width=537 height=432 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Explore Memory Lane! </i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play 2000s nostalgic minigames with <strong>Piñata Puppy</strong>, <strong>Gay Gecko</strong> and <strong>Lorus Lochness</strong> to prepare for the birthday party!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363050/extras/f71957a85b63f7a89306798dd5407583.avif?t=1781403678\" width=491 height=291 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i> </i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: right\">Explore around Memory Lane and talk to the new Website exclusive shopkeeper characters, talk with <strong>Rae Rodent</strong> at the Bakery and <span class=\"bb_strike\">learn about educational history quotes with</span> the town Historian <strong>Brandon Badger</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: right\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363050/extras/dce70531112b26fc41771d2c42cc0f48.avif?t=1781403678\" width=489 height=285 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Take a trip down Memory Lane!</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Listen to the <strong>CDMQKidz Online Radio</strong>, watch videos, print out coloring pages, and listen to music all within the world of your incredible imagination! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363050/extras/b0eeec8a7b10c167d5cfd5f830d51c20.avif?t=1781403678\" width=622 height=654 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>What are you waiting for? <i><u>Play Now!</u></i></strong></h2></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363050/extras/75091d65cf24a556b1892feca58ca458.avif?t=1781403678\" alt=\"Do you remember Piñata Puppy World?\" width=1560 height=389 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >To the best of your memory, <strong>you’ve forgotten</strong> the beloved Children’s Museum of your past.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through the lens of a <strong>VHS camcorder</strong>, the game is able to tackle and tell you, the player, a story about nostalgia as we try and step into the past, wondering why we can’t remember the Children’s Museum, <i>“Piñata Puppy World”.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Gameplay:</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363050/extras/fbf3bc168a0948670f034d8314df3ddf.avif?t=1781403678\" width=1236 height=937 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363050/extras/0fe17e147c8e75663b85d71be4a2fc85.webp?t=1781403678\" width=161 height=30 /></span>🌎</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Piñata Puppy World is a children's museum meant to bridge the gap between the in-universe kid's program &quot;The Piñata Puppy Show&quot; and the real world! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363050/extras/f0da2e9b956d9ab0f566b76b1a8882be.webp?t=1781403678\" width=223 height=30 /></span>📷</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using your camera. The (literal) lens through which you'll play the game, you'll be able to take pictures wherever and whenever you like, and using special 'MemorySaverz' machines, you'll be able to save your progress!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: right\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363050/extras/a73d872aacb20c53ea0fa27d96fe3fb4.webp?t=1781403678\" width=133 height=30 /></span>🔓</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: right\">To explore Piñata Puppy World, you'll need to utilize the environment to your advantage, so keep an eye out for keycards, gates and employee hallways for more options to navigate through the Funderdome.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363050/extras/e18ab7f4b7bae7ae863358e946a7b381.webp?t=1781403678\" width=161 height=30 /></span>🧠</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Interact with everything you can across the Funderdome! You can grab sodas from the vending machines, climb the jungle gym of Gymnasium Onwards, utilize the elevators across employee hallways, and find hidden collectibles scattered across the environment!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363050/extras/8dd2ee87a133ac69e4386f6ec26bbfc8.poster.avif?t=1781403678\" width=1000 height=750 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363050/extras/8dd2ee87a133ac69e4386f6ec26bbfc8.webm?t=1781403678\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363050/extras/8dd2ee87a133ac69e4386f6ec26bbfc8.mp4?t=1781403678\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong><br><i>Deeper you go...</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The deeper</strong> you step into Piñata Puppy World, the further you step <strong>out-of-bounds</strong> of your own memory. As you continue to explore, the world might not represent itself the same as you last thought you remembered it… and possibly change when you least expect...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">But remember this. It's all about you.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363050/extras/75091d65cf24a556b1892feca58ca458.avif?t=1781403678\" alt=\"Do you remember Piñata Puppy World?\" width=1560 height=389 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >To the best of your memory, <strong>you’ve forgotten</strong> the beloved Children’s Museum of your past.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through the lens of a <strong>VHS camcorder</strong>, the game is able to tackle and tell you, the player, a story about nostalgia as we try and step into the past, wondering why we can’t remember the Children’s Museum, <i>“Piñata Puppy World”.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Gameplay:</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363050/extras/fbf3bc168a0948670f034d8314df3ddf.avif?t=1781403678\" width=1236 height=937 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363050/extras/0fe17e147c8e75663b85d71be4a2fc85.webp?t=1781403678\" width=161 height=30 /></span>🌎</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Piñata Puppy World is a children's museum meant to bridge the gap between the in-universe kid's program &quot;The Piñata Puppy Show&quot; and the real world! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363050/extras/f0da2e9b956d9ab0f566b76b1a8882be.webp?t=1781403678\" width=223 height=30 /></span>📷</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using your camera. The (literal) lens through which you'll play the game, you'll be able to take pictures wherever and whenever you like, and using special 'MemorySaverz' machines, you'll be able to save your progress!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: right\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363050/extras/a73d872aacb20c53ea0fa27d96fe3fb4.webp?t=1781403678\" width=133 height=30 /></span>🔓</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: right\">To explore Piñata Puppy World, you'll need to utilize the environment to your advantage, so keep an eye out for keycards, gates and employee hallways for more options to navigate through the Funderdome.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363050/extras/e18ab7f4b7bae7ae863358e946a7b381.webp?t=1781403678\" width=161 height=30 /></span>🧠</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Interact with everything you can across the Funderdome! You can grab sodas from the vending machines, climb the jungle gym of Gymnasium Onwards, utilize the elevators across employee hallways, and find hidden collectibles scattered across the environment!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363050/extras/8dd2ee87a133ac69e4386f6ec26bbfc8.poster.avif?t=1781403678\" width=1000 height=750 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363050/extras/8dd2ee87a133ac69e4386f6ec26bbfc8.webm?t=1781403678\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363050/extras/8dd2ee87a133ac69e4386f6ec26bbfc8.mp4?t=1781403678\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong><br><i>Deeper you go...</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The deeper</strong> you step into Piñata Puppy World, the further you step <strong>out-of-bounds</strong> of your own memory. As you continue to explore, the world might not represent itself the same as you last thought you remembered it… and possibly change when you least expect...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">But remember this. It's all about you.</p>", "short_description": "Through the lens of a VHS camera, you explore your memories of a children’s Museum you can’t quite remember, trying to find the answer behind the mystery of: “What is Piñata Puppy World?”", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Latin America<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363050/header.jpg?t=1781403678", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363050/bd1dc0649c39447b733f8ca353990a2c4cc04c6f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1781403678", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363050/bd1dc0649c39447b733f8ca353990a2c4cc04c6f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1781403678", "website": "https://pinatapuppyworld.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Real Time Studio"], "publishers": ["Real Time Studio"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 28, "description": "Full controller support"}, {"id": 55, "description": "DualShock Controller Support"}, {"id": 56, "description": "DualShock Controller Support"}, {"id": 57, "description": "DualSense Controller Support"}, {"id": 58, "description": "DualSense Controller Support"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "25", "description": "Adventure"}, {"id": "23", "description": "Indie"}, {"id": "28", "description": "Simulation"}], "screenshots": [{"id": 0, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363050/d6a2912b1611150909ea043027443c4d3cdd5f28/ss_d6a2912b1611150909ea043027443c4d3cdd5f28.600x3